<decision #track.rename_ontology_om_class_object_contract.scope {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
}
(
  <question ?>本 track 是否只覆盖 Class/Object/Field/FieldValue，而把 RelationLink、ComputedProp、Operation 留给后续 track？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>Mission G2 splits these areas into two ontology-core tracks.</?>
    <decision-text ?>本 track 只覆盖 Class/Object/Field/FieldValue 存储与公开契约。</?>
    <rationale ?>RelationLink、ComputedProp、Operation 涉及行为、权限、interceptor、registry、scripting 与导入导出，适合单独 track。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission G2-T1 and G2-T2 are separate TrackLink leaves.</?>
  )
  >
)
>
